[$] key={"C"} | time={4,4} | bpm={100}

---
; ^ punctuation.delimiter

[^] p={1} | cre={3,6}

[S] |d    :r    !m    :f    |`s   :l   `!t    :-    |da+1 :-    !     :     ||
;                                                     ^ type.qualifier
;                                                       ^ number
;                                                          ^ constant.builtin
[T] |d    :r    !m    :f    |`s   :l   `!t    :-    |da+1 :-    !     :     ||
[A] |d    :r    !m    :f    |`s   :l   `!t    :-    |da+1 :-    !     :     ||
[B] |d    :r    !m    :f    |`s   :l   `!t    :-    |da+1 :-    !     :     ||

[1] do    `re`  mi\   (f a) so    la    ti_   i     do_   o.    ~     ~     ..
[2] do    `re`  mi\   (f a) so    la    ti_   i     do_   o.    ~     ~     .. ; scream
